{"id":944,"date":"2024-11-25T03:56:52","date_gmt":"2024-11-25T03:56:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dev.stage.nuiq.com\/blog\/?p=92"},"modified":"2024-11-25T03:56:52","modified_gmt":"2024-11-25T03:56:52","slug":"how-to-enable-microphone-access-on-ios","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nuiq.com\/blog\/how-to-enable-microphone-access-on-ios\/","title":{"rendered":"How To Enable Microphone Access on iOS"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/stage.nuiq.com\/articles\/img\/mic_perms.png\" alt=\"iOS Settings App Icon\" style=\"width:667px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>When you tap the record button in Q-Notes, your browser should ask for your permission to access your device&#8217;s Microphone. If you are not seeing this request and are getting an error about Microphone permissions, please follow these steps.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enable Safari Microphone Permissions<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Open the Settings app<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/stage.nuiq.com\/articles\/img\/settings.png\" alt=\"iOS Settings App Icon\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Scroll down and tap Safari<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/stage.nuiq.com\/articles\/img\/safari.png\" alt=\"Find and tap Safari in the list\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tap on Microphone under SETTINGS FOR WEBSITES<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/stage.nuiq.com\/articles\/img\/safarisettings.png\" alt=\"Find and tap Safari in the list\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Make sure Microphone Access is set to Ask or Allow<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/stage.nuiq.com\/articles\/img\/askmic.png\" alt=\"Set Mic access to ask or allow\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>When set to Ask, your permission will be requested for each website that wants to use your Microphone. When set to Allow, all websites will have access to your Microphone without your explicit permission.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>After making this change, return to Q-Notes&nbsp;and tap the Record button again. You should now be able to grant Mic access to NuIQ.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>When you tap the record button in Q-Notes, your browser should ask for your permission to access your device&#8217;s Microphone. If you are not seeing this request and are getting an error about Microphone permissions, please follow these steps. Enable Safari Microphone Permissions When set to Ask, your permission will be requested for each website&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":928,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_kad_post_transparent":"","_kad_post_title":"","_kad_post_layout":"","_kad_post_sidebar_id":"","_kad_post_content_style":"","_kad_post_vertical_padding":"","_kad_post_feature":"","_kad_post_feature_position":"","_kad_post_header":false,"_kad_post_footer":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[7],"tags":[8],"class_list":["post-944","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-support","tag-technical-support"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/nuiq.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/944","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/nuiq.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/nuiq.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/nuiq.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/nuiq.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=944"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/nuiq.com\/wp-json